{"created": "2026-11-11T23:29:13.981612+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-11T23:29:14.132456+00:00", "id": 24147967, "conceptrecid": "23444338", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24147967", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23444338", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24147967", "metadata": {"title": "The Yang-Mills Mass Gap from One Bound at One Scale", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24147967", "publication_date": "2026-11-12", "description": "We prove the mass gap of four-dimensional lattice Yang-Mills theory at strong coupling for every compact simple gauge group, with explicit bounds. For the continuum theories built on tori we prove that a mass gap and a unique vacuum follow from one bound on partition functions at one physical scale. That bound is open at weak coupling, and the unrenormalised loop variables are shown to have a trivial limit. The archive contains the paper, a Lean 4 project (265 theorems) and a Julia script (234 checks). The continuum mass gap is not proved.", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Bhattacharjee, Deep", "affiliation": "Formerly, Electro-Gravitational Space Propulsion Laboratory (EGSPL), Bhubaneswar, Odisha 751030, India; Formerly, University of Calcutta (Heramba Chandra College), 23/49 Gariahat Road, Golpark, Kolkata 700029, West Bengal, India", "orcid": "0000-0003-0466-750X"}, {"name": "Bhattacharya, Ushashi", "affiliation": "Formerly, National Taiwan University, Taipei 106319, Taiwan", "orcid": "0009-0002-2254-3914"}, {"name": "Lockwood, James Montgomery", "affiliation": "Independent Researcher, San Antonio, USA"}, {"name": "Romanov, Tristan", "affiliation": "Independent Researcher, San Francisco, CA, USA"}, {"name": "Sessford, Ikailo John", "affiliation": "Ikailo Inc., Whitby, Ontario, Canada", "orcid": "0009-0002-0150-4027"}, {"name": "Singha Roy, Sanjeevan", "affiliation": "Department of Physics, Birla Institute of Technology, Mesra, Ranchi, Jharkhand 835215, India", "orcid": "0000-0002-6148-1421"}], "keywords": ["Yang-Mills theory",